WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.790
Give a swing one big
push, then let go.

2
00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:06.290
Up, down, up, down.

3
00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:09.230
Each swing is a little
lower than the last.

4
00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:10.530
Then it stops.

5
00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:13.830
But energy can never be
created or destroyed.

6
00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:16.270
So where did the swing's energy go?

7
00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:17.870
Did it just vanish?

8
00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:21.150
In this mission, you'll follow
the energy as it moves between

9
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:22.750
the swing's stores.

10
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.910
You'll find out what
dissipation means,

11
00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:27.570
what happens when a hot
object touches a cold one,

12
00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:30.870
and how insulation keeps a home warm.

13
00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:33.630
Your mission: explain
why a swing stops,

14
00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:36.010
if energy is never lost.
